&#xD;
Proces je namodelovan&amp;#253; pod&#x13E;a &amp;#167; 167u rozvrh v&amp;#253;&#x165;ažku.&#xD;
IS REPLIK  umož&#x148;uje spr&amp;#225;vcovi zostavi&#x165;, zverejni&#x165; rozvrh a verite&#x13E;ovi poda&#x165; podnet na s&amp;#250;d, ay ten zmenil poradie uspokojovania verite&#x13E;ov.&#xD;
Spr&amp;#225;vca prepracuje rozvrh ak mu s&amp;#250;d tak ulož&amp;#237; a po fin&amp;#225;lnom schv&amp;#225;len&amp;#237; rozvrh sprc&amp;#225;va zverejn&amp;#237; pomocou IS REPLIK.</bpmn:documentation><bpmn:ioSpecification><bpmn:dataOutput id="EAID_1124AF10_26E8_41fe_85F1_82A52EEB4CF4" name="Rozhodnutie o schválení rozvrhu" isCollection="false"/><bpmn:dataOutput id="EAID_99D9F479_3289_41c4_9E88_5EE12314DA1B" name="Schválený rozvrh" isCollection="false"/><bpmn:inputSet/><bpmn:outputSet><bpmn:dataOutputRefs>EAID_99D9F479_3289_41c4_9E88_5EE12314DA1B</bpmn:dataOutputRefs><bpmn:dataOutputRefs>EAID_1124AF10_26E8_41fe_85F1_82A52EEB4CF4</bpmn:dataOutputRefs></bpmn:outputSet></bpmn:ioSpecification><bpmn:laneSet id="EAID_LS000000_32C2_4ae5_8FEA_8C7ECBFBB007"><bpmn:lane id="EAID_F582BC93_54DE_4004_A7CC_85AFA5E181BA" name="Systém"/><bpmn:lane id="EAID_2531DB59_2DF7_4233_8F46_2990D0A9FBCE" name="Verite&#x13E;"><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_0FCAC970_A39C_4001_9EF8_C92CA1E5FE1D</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_DACC38C6_FD98_40b8_85B3_EB56F87D5C8E</bpmn:flowNodeRef></bpmn:lane><bpmn:lane id="EAID_2E639829_2939_4a52_B9D8_E48AEDD56626" name="Správca"><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_29BA7ED0_CEB2_4e7b_A4B3_28363502C4C3</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_9439006D_97C1_4eec_8C22_1E85502B0DC8</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_FA80F695_0C39_450d_AC95_AA63F51E380C</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_DB70A2F2_3BC8_406c_9203_3BC9F23E3D0C</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_D47D48C4_1E00_4f1f_8DEA_FF434BA76F1C</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_B34BF1EF_901B_42ec_A7CC_199B01C438EB</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_CD4C505C_A5CD_4bd7_9809_29051C5F35C6</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_4EAF7E2F_1D9C_4243_A586_5F30E4AB2C24</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_F0F7D20D_5589_47e3_875F_BFFA59D11601</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_E3CA5617_A3EF_4bf0_93D5_978FE191F6AD</bpmn:flowNodeRef><bpmn:flowNodeRef>EAID_6E417AC2_F408_41fa_B1AE_8AEDAEA4EDE5</bpm